  "narrative": {
    "text": "Proposed EIR architecture: 'Existing Birth Registration system (by NIRA)' feeds, through a data-entry step, an 'Electronic Immunization Registry (EIR)' with: Child Identification (Via NIRA/VRS integration); Vaccine Record Module; Scheduling and Reminders; Data Analytics and Reporting. The EIR serves a 'User Interface' for: Healthcare providers; Patients (via app/portal); District/MoH.",
